OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after bomb hoax puts school
OL,4,Ainto lockdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after several
OL,7,Fbuildings, including a secondary
OL,8,Fschool, received hoax bomb threats via
OL,9,Femail.
OL,11,FBishop Stopford School in Kettering,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, went into temporary
OL,13,Flockdown on Wednesday as a
OL,14,Fprecautionary measure following what it
OL,15,Fcalled an "alert".
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Police said an
OL,18,F18-year-old man was being held in
OL,19,Fcustody on suspicion of communicating
OL,20,Ffalse information.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
