OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after bomb hoax puts school
OL,4,Ainto lockdown
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Although the buildings are no longer
OL,7,Funder lockdown, neighbourhood policing
OL,8,Fofficers remain on hand for reassurance
OL,9,Fpurposes," it added.
